EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

We have been attempting to reach you regarding your account that has moved into default for non-payment. There is still time to resolve your account. We have modification programs available to assist. If we do not hear from you, we will have to proceed with chargeoff at the end of this month. At which time the account will be reported to business credit as a default and forwarded to our Legal Department for possible litigation.

Please contact us to make arrangements.


Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
